# muster route golden — every route RegisterRoutes registers, sorted.
#
# Generated by: UPDATE_ROUTES_GOLDEN=1 go test ./internal/api -run TestRoutesMatchGolden
# then READ the diff in `git diff` before committing it.
#
# Patterns only. This file does NOT record auth wrappers — see the KNOWN LIMIT
# banner in routes_golden_test.go before treating a clean diff here as evidence
# that a route's authorisation tier has not changed. It is not.
#
# 🔴 THIS FILE IS DELIBERATELY EMPTY OF ROUTES, AND THAT IS AN ASSERTED STATE,
# NOT AN OVERSIGHT. muster has no HTTP server yet; RegisterRoutes registers
# nothing. `routePhase` in routes_golden_test.go is `pre-traffic`, and in that
# phase the gate's positive control does not merely tolerate an empty set — it
# parses the module's own sources and FAILS if any literal route pattern exists
# anywhere. So an empty golden here is checked against the code rather than
# being the reason the check passes.
#
# The route lines go below this header, one per line, when Phase 2 lands them.
